    "detailed_description": "<strong>Solitar Retro Picks</strong> is a collection of relaxing and challenging solitaire games, perfect to play while listening to an audio book or while binge watching your latest favorite TV series.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Many of the card games allow for solvable play or the standard random play.<br></li><li> Ability to view solutions of solvable games.<br></li><li> Ability to play specific seeds.<br></li><li> Ability to play using unlimited undo.<br></li><li> Most games include their most popular variants.<br></li><li> Themes<br></li><li> Controller Support.<br></li><li> Steam Deck Support.<br></li><li> Achievements (available for certain game modes).<br></li><li> Cloud Saving.</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong><u>No Ads</u></strong><br></li><li><strong><u>No Microtransactions</u></strong><br></li><li><strong><u>No Day-1 DLC</u></strong><br></li><li><strong><u>No Subscriptions</u></strong></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Includes 18 &quot;Solitaire&quot; Games</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974650/extras/9b4efbdfcda7c10c68b1aa378e4e3e88.webp?t=1749925264\" width=400 height=50 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974650/extras/d3a6f48615130f0d9650317ce08f5551.webp?t=1749925264\" width=400 height=50 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974650/extras/297486bf10e34a8230916c89954fd289.webp?t=1749925264\" width=400 height=50 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974650/extras/f10c3ed0849ad2cc7a6fb750e0307461.webp?t=1749925264\" width=400 height=50 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.ak